## Implementation Details

The Analytics component follows Vercel's recommended setup for Next.js App Router:
- Uses the Next.js-specific import path: `@vercel/analytics/next`
- Placed inside `<body>` tag for proper tracking across all pages
- Positioned after main content to avoid blocking initial page render
- Will automatically track page views and Web Vitals

