No action required. The implementation is complete and ready for deployment. Once deployed to Vercel:
1. Analytics data will automatically be collected
2. View metrics in the Vercel dashboard under the Analytics tab
3. Track page views, Web Vitals (FCP, LCP, CLS, FID, INP), and user engagement

